    <div class=3D"row s-lg-row"><div id=3D"s-lg-col-126" class=3D"col-md-12=
"><div class=3D"s-lg-col-boxes"></div></div></div><div class=3D"row s-lg-ro=
w"><div id=3D"s-lg-col-1" class=3D"col-md-12"><div class=3D"s-lg-col-boxes"=
><div id=3D"s-lg-box-wrapper-39850149" class=3D"s-lg-box-wrapper-39850149">


    <div id=3D"s-lg-box-33889284-container" class=3D"s-lib-box-container">
        <div id=3D"s-lg-box-33889284" class=3D"s-lib-box s-lib-box-std">
                            <h2 class=3D"s-lib-box-title">
                    Trump Trackers
                                    </h2>
                        <div id=3D"s-lg-box-collapse-33889284">
                <div class=3D"s-lib-box-content">
                    <div id=3D"s-lg-content-79640903" class=3D"  clearfix">
    <p><span style=3D"font-size:14px;">These tools may be helpful in keepin=
g track of the many changes being made by the Trump administration. The lis=
t is updated as I become aware of new resources; no paywalled sites are inc=
luded. Note that some of these resources overlap categories (e.g. DOGE and =
Federal Workforce &amp; Offices), so you may want to review related categor=
ies. Please feel free to contact me at <a href=3D"mailto:k5smith@ucsd.edu">=
k5smith@ucsd.edu</a> with suggestions/comments.</span></p>

<hr>
<p><span style=3D"font-size:14px;"><strong>Apportionment</strong></span></p=
>

<ul>
	<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;"><a href=3D"https://openomb.org/">OpenO=
MB </a>(via Protect Democracy)</span>

	<ul>
		<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;">tracks how the president, acting thro=
ugh the Office of Management and Budget, implements Congress's spending law=
s</span></li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>

<p><span style=3D"font-size:14px;"><strong>Arts</strong></span></p>

<ul>
	<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;"><a href=3D"https://artisticfreedominit=
iative.org/artistic-freedom-monitor/">AFM Tracker</a>&nbsp;(via Artistic Fr=
eedom Initiative)</span>

	<ul>
		<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;">tracks&nbsp;federal and state governm=
ent actions that narrow artistic freedom and weaken the independence of art=
s and cultural institutions in the US</span></li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;"><a href=3D"https://www.pittsburghartsc=
ouncil.org/blog/trumps-impact-arts-running-list-updates">Trump=E2=80=99s Im=
pact on the Arts: A Running List of Updates</a> (via&nbsp;Greater Pittsburg=
h Arts Council)</span>
	<ul>
		<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;">tracks executive actions that threate=
n the arts</span></li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>

<p><span style=3D"font-size:14px;"><strong>Cabinet/Appointees/Nominees</str=
ong></span></p>

<ul>
	<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;"><a href=3D"https://ourpublicservice.or=
g/performance-measures/political-appointee-tracker/">Political Appointee Tr=
acker</a> (via Partnership for Public Service/Washington Post)</span>

	<ul>
		<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;">tracks status of&nbsp;political appoi=
nted&nbsp;positions that require Senate confirmation</span></li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;"><a href=3D"https://afsa.org/list-ambas=
sadorial-appointments">Tracker: Current U.S. Ambassadors</a>&nbsp;(via Amer=
ican Foreign Service Association)</span>
	<ul>
		<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;">tracks&nbsp;nominated and confirmed U=
.S. Ambassadors abroad, as well as other senior positions in the Foreign Se=
rvice and related agencies</span></li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;"><span class=3D"tape1 -white" reveal=3D=
"/1" revealed=3D""><span class=3D"tape1-inner"><a href=3D"https://www.citiz=
en.org/article/tracker-trump-appointees-in-the-pocket-of-big-corporations/"=
>Trump Appointees=E2=80=99 Corporate Conflicts of Interest</a> (via Public =
Citizen)</span></span></span>
	<ul>
		<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;">tracks prior employment and former cl=
ients/business interests</span></li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;"><a href=3D"https://apnews.com/projects=
/trump-cabinet-confirmation-tracker/">Trump Cabinet confirmation status: Wh=
ich nominees have been confirmed?</a> (via AP)</span></li>
	<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;"><a href=3D"https://www.citizensforethi=
cs.org/reports-investigations/crew-reports/tracking-trumps-unprecedented-of=
ten-illegal-firings-of-political-appointees-and-watchdogs/">Trump firings t=
racker</a> (via CREW)</span>
	<ul>
		<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;">tracks<span style=3D"font-weight: 400=
"> current status of political appointees' firings, including position, age=
ncy, date fired, legality of the firing and the status of any litigation fi=
led</span></span></li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;"><a href=3D"https://demandjustice.org/t=
rump-nominees/">Trump's Nominees</a> (via Demand Justice)</span>
	<ul>
		<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;">tracks judicial nominations</span></l=
i>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>

<p><span style=3D"font-size:14px;"><strong>Campaign Promises</strong></span=
></p>

<ul>
	<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;"><a href=3D"https://www.politifact.com/=
truth-o-meter/promises/maga-meter-tracking-donald-trumps-2024-promises/">MA=
GA-Meter: Trump's Second Term</a> (via Politifact)</span>

	<ul>
		<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;">tracks campaign promises and rates wh=
ether the promise was achieved</span></li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;"><a href=3D"https://apnews.com/projects=
/trump-campaign-promise-tracker/">Tracking Trump's presidential promises</a=
> (via AP)</span>
	<ul>
		<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;">tracks status of campaign promises; l=
inks to related AP articles for additional information</span></li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>

<p><span style=3D"font-size:14px;"><strong>Climate/Environment/Science</str=
ong></span></p>

<ul>
	<li><span style=3D"font-size:14px;"><a href=3D"https://www.actonclimate.co=
m/trumptracker/">Climate &amp; Clean Energy Rollback Tracker</a> (via Clima=
te Action Campaign)</span>

	<ul>
